d 'qdid': module for quantile treatment effects in difference-in-differences
d
d Implements Callaway & Li (2019, Quantitative Economics 10(4): 1579-1618):
d quantile treatment effects on the treated (QTT) in two-period DiD, with
d cluster-bootstrap pointwise intervals and a multiplier-bootstrap uniform
d confidence band across quantiles. Optional covariates for conditional
d distributional parallel trends (Callaway-Li, Proposition 1).
d
d Author: Haoyu Niu
d Distribution-Date: 20261006
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
f qdid.ado
f qdid.sthlp
